# Prayer of Binding has flash (CR 702.8a): Bot1 casts it on Bot2's turn 2 for exactly {3}{W} from four Mox Pearls. Its enters
# ability exiles "up to one target nonland permanent an opponent controls" (CR 610.3): Bot1's own Mox Pearl (a nonland permanent,
# but not an opponent's) and Bot2's Plains (an opponent's permanent, but a land) are refused, Bot2's Mox Jet is exiled, and Bot2's
# Memnite and Bot1's Moxen stay (two targets at once are refused, "up to one"). Bot1 gains 2 life (20 -> 22).

